{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgwv89bqjRwCqxqbHjCPk","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The LATE is about 3.29. I estimated it with the Wald instrumental-variable estimator, using push assignment as the instrument for push delivery. This is equivalent to two-stage least squares with one instrument. I computed it as a ratio of group means rather than running a regression package.\n\n- **Effect of assignment on purchases (reduced form):** mean in-app purchases were 71.66 for assigned users and 69.29 for unassigned users, a difference of about 2.36.\n- **Effect of assignment on delivery (first stage):** 71.76% of assigned users received the push, and none of the unassigned users did, so the difference is 0.7176.\n- **LATE:** 2.36 / 0.7176 ≈ 3.29.\n\nANSWER: 3.29"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":362,"cache_read_input_tokens":30531,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":362},"output_tokens":250,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2de3d2f7-1d9f-4cb9-8bb7-595a6553556a","uuid":"8a453d67-9e54-4896-b6aa-e20cb8ea4702","timestamp":"2026-11-11T22:18:38.629Z","request_id":"req_011Cgwv89NhThC8ak6cnnuqK"}
